  "bodyHash": "3DbbBfoWnUU=",
  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fgold-nugget-recycling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/bf84aa11b4afd69cdbd20a199bc6d93c50fac58b.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gold-nugget-recycling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3531508338997863e0b15c2252d16bf51ceb5669.png\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/gold-nugget-recycling/settings/data-pack/gold-nugget-recycling/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/eac8caa46edda35d821be9a2e1a8e16a00a9cadc.png\" alt=\"Planet Minecraft\"></a></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><hr><p><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">金粒回收</span>讓你可以將大多數需要黃金的物品熔煉成金粒。當你合成太多動力鐵軌，或是想從金胡蘿蔔中回收一些黃金時，這個功能會非常實用。</p><p>這是一個模組，<strong>資料包版本可於</strong><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/gold-nugget-recycling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>此處</strong></a>取得。</p><p><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">若需要鐵粒回收，請查看&nbsp;<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iron-nugget-recycling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">鐵粒回收</a>！</span></p><hr><p>現在可熔煉成金粒的物品列表：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>閃耀西瓜</li>\n<li>金蘋果</li>\n<li>附魔金蘋果</li>\n<li>金胡蘿蔔</li>\n<li>時鐘</li>\n<li>動力鐵軌</li>\n<li>輕質壓力板</li>\n<li>鑲金黑石</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div><p><br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/EGpifGzW/images/188b44264ed0dc91eb738bca8e8fcdc477b4355f.png\" alt=\"可熔煉成金粒的物品列表\"></p><hr>",
